            "sid": "HEB 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi chilagane cha kpwandza kala china phatu phapha duniani pha kumuabudira Mlungu, na malagizo ga kulongozera iyo ibada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.23+EXO.25.24+EXO.25.25+EXO.25.26+EXO.25.27+EXO.25.28+EXO.25.29+EXO.25.30+EXO.25.31+EXO.25.32+EXO.25.33+EXO.25.34+EXO.25.35+EXO.25.36+EXO.25.37+EXO.25.38+EXO.25.39+EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 25:23–40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.1+EXO.26.2+EXO.26.3+EXO.26.4+EXO.26.5+EXO.26.6+EXO.26.7+EXO.26.8+EXO.26.9+EXO.26.10+EXO.26.11+EXO.26.12+EXO.26.13+EXO.26.14+EXO.26.15+EXO.26.16+EXO.26.17+EXO.26.18+EXO.26.19+EXO.26.20+EXO.26.21+EXO.26.22+EXO.26.23+EXO.26.24+EXO.26.25+EXO.26.26+EXO.26.27+EXO.26.28+EXO.26.29+EXO.26.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:1–30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hema ra kumuabudira Mlungu ratengezwa na kala rina vyumba viiri. Chumba cha kpwandza kala muna chiguzo cha kuikira taa na meza yokala ichiikirwa mikahe mbere za Mlungu. Chumba hichi kala chichiihwa Phatu Phatakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.31+EXO.26.32+EXO.26.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 26:31–33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu kala kuna paziya, yoganya chumba cha kpwandza na cha phiri. Chumba cha phiri kala chichiihwa Phatu Phatakatifu Zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
