            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.2+NUM.18.3+NUM.18.4+NUM.18.5+NUM.18.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 18:2–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi vitu vyosi viriphotengezwa na kuikpwa, chila chitu phatuphe, alavyadzi-sadaka kala nkuinjira chila siku cho chumba cha kpwandza na kuhenda kazi yao ya kuabudu Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.2+LEV.16.3+LEV.16.4+LEV.16.5+LEV.16.6+LEV.16.7+LEV.16.8+LEV.16.9+LEV.16.10+LEV.16.11+LEV.16.12+LEV.16.13+LEV.16.14+LEV.16.15+LEV.16.16+LEV.16.17+LEV.16.18+LEV.16.19+LEV.16.20+LEV.16.21+LEV.16.22+LEV.16.23+LEV.16.24+LEV.16.25+LEV.16.26+LEV.16.27+LEV.16.28+LEV.16.29+LEV.16.30+LEV.16.31+LEV.16.32+LEV.16.33+LEV.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 16:2–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu macheye waruhusiwa kuinjira chumba cha phiri, naye kala nkuinjira limwenga bahi kpwa mwaka. Tsona kala ni lazima ainjire na mlatso kpwa kumlavira Mlungu sadaka kpwa kudziusira dambize mwenye na za atu anjina osi arizohenda bila ya kumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi kulengana na mipango hiyo, Roho Mtakatifu anahuonyesa wazi kala ro hema ra kare ra Mlungu richikala richere kuhumika, njira ya kuinjirira Phatu Phatakatifu Zaidi taidzangbwevugulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huno mfwano unahusu siku zizi hurizo nazo, mana zawadi na sadaka zinazolaviwa ni anaoabudu taziweza kutakasa mioyo yao ili isiahukumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sababu malagizo higa ganahusu marya, vinwadzi, na kudzitakasa chimwiri bahi, na kazi za higo malagizo zindasira pho Mlungu ndiphogaluza mambo gosi gakale maphya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
