              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jesu wakpwedza dza mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu wa mambo gosi manono gokpwedza. Wainjira hema risiro na ila ririro mlunguni, ambaro tariyatengezwa ni binadamu wala si seemu ya dunia hino youmbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye wamenya hipho phatu phatakatifu limwenga bahi, nayo yatosha siku zosi. Na kayamenya kuno akatsukula mlatso wa mbuzi na wa ana ngʼombe, ela wahala mlatsowe mwenye. Naye wahuriphira wokofu wehu wa kare na kare kpwa sadakaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.15+LEV.16.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 16:15–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 19:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.17+NUM.19.18+NUM.19.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulengana na chilagane cha kare, milatso ya mbuzi na ya ndzau na ivu ra ndama kala richitimvirwa ario najisi kuhenda miri yao itakaswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mlatso wa Jesu una nguvu zaidi sana! Unatakasa mioyo yehu ili husienderere kuhenda gara garehago chifo, ela humhumikire Mlungu aishiye. Mana kpwa nguvu za ye Rohowe, Jesu wadzilavya kpwa Mlungu dza sadaka isiyo na ila yoyosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa sababu hiyo, Jesu ndiye mpatanishi wa chilagane chiphya ili hara ariotsambulwa aphokere uzima wa kare na kare uriolagbwa ni Mlungu. Mana Jesu wafwa ili aakombole kula kpwa dambi zao arizohenda wakati wa chilagane cha kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mutu achiika wasiya wa ufwawe, ni lazima ye ahalwaye ufwa, akale wafwa kpweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wasiya una nguvu ichikala kpweli hiye ahalwaye ufwa, wafwa. Ela tauna nguvu ichikala ye ariyelagiza kuhalwa ufwa achere moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo mana hata chilagane cha kare chaikpwa na milatso ya nyama yomwagika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.6+EXO.24.7+EXO.24.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 24:6–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ariphomala kusomera Aiziraeli shariya zosi za Mlungu, wahala milatso ya ana ngʼombe na mbuzi, phamwenga na madzi, pamba ya kundu, na phungo ra muhisopo. Chisha achitimvira-timvira chitabu cha Shariya za Mlungu phamwenga na atu osi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achiamba, “Huno ni mlatso unaohakikisha chilagane cha Mlungu ambacho walagiza mchilunge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 8:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivyo hivyo, Musa watimvira-timvira milatso hema ra mkpwutano na vitu vyosi vyokala vinahumirwa wakati wa kumuabudu Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 17:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana kulengana na Shariya, milatso ndiyo ihumirwayo kutakasa karibu chila chitu, na bila ya milatso kumwagika, dambi taziweza kuswamehewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hema ra phapha duniani na vituvye vyokala vichihumirwa kulavira sadaka ni mfwano wa vira vya mlunguni, na vivyo vyakala vichitakaswa na milatso ya nyama. Ela vitu vyenye vya hiko mlunguni, ni lazima vitakaswe na sadaka nono zaidi kuriko iyo milatso ya nyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Jesu kayainjira phatu phatakatifu photengezwa ni binadamu, ambapho ni mfwano tu wa pho phatu pharipho hiko mlunguni. Ela wainjira mlunguni kpwenye, ambako sambi a mbere za Mlungu kpwa ajili yehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona Jesu kayainjira mlunguni kudzilavya sadaka mara kpwa mara. Kayakala dza mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu ambaye nkuinjira Phatu Phatakatifu Zaidi mwaka bada ya mwaka, kpwa kulavya mlatso usiokala wakpwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kala ni hivyo Jesu angekala wakola kano nyinji hangu kuumbwa kpwa dunia. Ela sivyo! Wakpwedza limwenga siku zizi za mwisho, ili ahuusire dambi zehu kpwa kudzilavya sadaka ye mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na dza viratu ambavyo ni lazima anadamu osi afwe limwenga na badaye ahukumiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 53:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vivyo hivyo, Jesu walaviwa sadaka limwenga ili ahale dambi za atu anji. Na andakpwedza kano ya phiri, si kpwa kuusa dambi, ela kuarehera wokofu hara amgodzerao kpwa hamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
